    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A facility run by a mysterious director conducting research into quantifying fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user will be a test subject there, undergoing terrifying experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple game in which the player must simply endure the terror of cockroaches without being scared.<br><br>Features<br>1.Single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Explore the laboratory to locate the giant cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Encounter cockroaches of various sizes throughout your journey. Endure the terror as they creep toward you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Complete the game by defeating the giant cockroach and escaping from the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.Gameplay duration: Approximately 15-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
